Package: xfdesktop4
Version: @DEB_XFDESKTOP_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: System
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfdesktop/start
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-3-0, libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-0, libxfce4util7, libxfce4ui-2-0, libexo-2-0, libgarcon-1-0, xfconf, libwnck-3-0
Description: Desktop manager for the Xfce desktop environment
 xfdesktop sets the desktop background, draws desktop icons and provides the
 right-click applications/window menu on the root window.
